HST Office: a "Vietnamese" ("Tiếng Việt") function category in HST Sheets.

The bundled extension adds the Sheets functions DOCSO, DOCTIEN, BODAU, TACHHO and TACHTEN
(CalcAddIns.xcu, Category "Vietnamese"). Add-in categories are a fixed list in the core, so
they would land in "Add-in" next to unrelated functions. This adds category 12 "Vietnamese"
after "Add-in" in the Function Wizard and in the Functions sidebar list; an add-in naming any
other category still falls back to "Add-in". Built-in functions are unchanged.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
Test: tests/runtime/check-vietnamese-utilities.py. CppunitTest_sc_ucalc testFunctionLists expects the extra
category (its fixed table ended at "Add-in", so the 12th category read past the table and crashed the test;
the Function Wizard and the Functions sidebar deck list the category and its functions correctly).
